<title>USA: Marriott completes Renaissance acquisition.</title>
<headline>Marriott completes Renaissance acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marriott International Inc said Monday it has completed the acquisition of Renaissance Hotel Group N.V.</p>
<p>Shareholders of the Renaissance Hotel Group received $30 per share in cash.</p>
<p>As announced on February 18, Marriott agreed to acquire Renaissance Hotel Group for a total acquisition cost of about $1 billion, including transaction costs and existing net debt of Renaissance.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
